request.description:
Disconnect the Fitbit account from the user's profile.
Clears all stored tokens and marks smartwatch as disconnected.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Fitbit disconnected successfully",
  "data": {
    "connected": false,
    "type": null
  }
}
```
